"""pdiag_graph: import graphs of 2-4 modules (chains, a diamond, stars, a shared leaf, a fan
below the entry, imports listed out of order). Every module declares its own ADT, record,
opaque type, measure and functions and uses each module it imports. Errors are injected
into 1-4 modules: local ones and ones whose cause is in an imported module (arity, type,
missing member, constructor misuse, record fields, non-exhaustive match over the imported
ADT, purity of an imported effectful function, units, opaque types, unknown types), so
the per-module `-- module X (x.pyfun) --` groups, their order and the total are checked.
The clean graphs go through every command.

Generated by add/pfedge/tools/gen_pdiag.py (fixed seed); expected transcripts and written
files were captured from the reference binary.
"""

